co_return, co_await and co_yield are parsed ([dcl.fct.def.coroutine]/1:
f and g are coroutines).  Coroutines are not supported: each coroutine
gets a property that fails when it is called, and the path ends there, so
that verification does not report results for a program whose coroutines
ran as ordinary functions (cpp20_coroutine_generator_semantics).  g is
not called, so its property holds.
